            <common:generalComment xml:lang="en">The run-of-river hydropower station is assumed to have a small reservoir where the water is retained. This leads to a higher consumption of land as well as to greenhouse gas emissions due to the collected biomass.  Efficiency: 0.82. The data set describes a mix and is therefore not representative for individual plants. This dataset is recalculated based on Frischknecht et al. (1996) and Bauer (2007), complemented with data from Vattenfall (2008) and Axpo (2008);
UUID: f74d4fd8-12d1-383d-adb8-6f9e096b86c8</common:generalComment>
