        <technology>
            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">Mix of run-of-river hydropower plants built between 1945 and 1980, representative for Europe. Efficiency: 0.82.\n\n# Included processes\nOperation of average of run-of-river power stations with a small reservoir. It includes the land area transformed and occupied, lubricant oil consumption, spill and disposal, turbined water and greenhouse gas emissions.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
